Description: ShulGo minyan finder for Jewbuntu (panel widget and window)
 Nearby minyanim with a countdown, events, mikvaos and zmanim from ShulGo,
 as a GNOME top-bar widget and a GTK4/libadwaita window sharing one set of
 settings. Keeps the last good answer for offline use. Needs a per-user
 ShulGo API key; none is included.
